     1046   FUNCTION get-display-name RETURNS CHARACTER
     1047     ( buffer buf_temp-menu-item for temp-menu-item )  FORWARD.
     1048   DEFINE VAR C-Win AS WIDGET-HANDLE NO-UNDO.
