     6909           view-as alert-box information .
     6910       end.
     6911       else do:
     6912   if (valid-handle(g#libbcrcn) <> true) then do:   run str/libbcrcn.p persistent no-error .   if error-status :error or (valid-handle(g#libbcrcn) <> true) then do:     message       "Error starting libbcrcn.p" skip       g#libbcrcn skip       g#libbcrcn :type skip       g#libbcrcn :file-name skip       error-status :get-message(1) skip       return-value skip       view-as alert-box error .     stop .   end. end. run libbcrcn_bc-rcnz in g#libbcrcn
     6913   (
     6914    input  this-procedure
     6915   ,input  fi-bar-code
